feat(symmetry-functions): add Behler-Parrinello ACSFs

New Behler-Parrinello atom-centered symmetry functions:
- symmetry_functions(): compute G2, G4, G5 descriptors
- ACSF_PARAMS_SIMPLE: default parameter set

G2 (radial): Gaussian functions probing distance shells
G4 (angular): Three-body terms with j-k distance
G5 (angular): Three-body terms without j-k distance

Features:
- Multi-element support with per-type/pair features
- Element filtering
- Cosine cutoff function
- Feature names for interpretability

Pure Python pedagogical implementation.
Ref: Behler & Parrinello, PRL 98, 146401 (2007)
17 tests, example notebook 23_symmetry_functions.ipynb
